                ('Colorful Spring Shoes', 'Step into Spring with our brand new collection!'),
                ('Summer Sale Extravaganza', 'Up to 75% off on all electronics!'),
                ('Gadgets for Everyone', 'Cool gadgets for every member of your family.'),
